{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797880/extras/Muerto.png?t=1749438846\" />\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SpeedCoins</strong> is a frantic <strong>2D platformer</strong> that combines action, exploration, and time control. Run, jump, and fight through worlds full of danger, hidden messages, and strange creatures. Master time to your advantage... and make sure you're faster than the coins if you want to survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797880/extras/shoot.gif?t=1749438846\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll shape your own destiny, change your skin along the way, but never lose sight of your goal. This is <strong>SpeedCoins!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the messages from someone special as you journey through unknown worlds. Explore the moon, the desert, and even the depths of hell!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fight.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dodge, shoot, and use your powers to battle anything that stands in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solve.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete unique puzzles and unlock hidden secrets in every world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797880/extras/gifn2.gif?t=1749438846\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Features:</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the secrets of each character and their story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump, teleport, shoot, and dodge!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your character as you like.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play without an internet connection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controller support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achievements with in-game rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 50 non-linear levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test your skills; fight bosses, diverse enemies... and even time itself!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique minigames inside the shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete unique puzzles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3797880?t=1749438846","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3797880?t=1749438846","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797880/dcd1724ef4cae2fa486ca9dd5051746b1e21b45f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749438846","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797880/dcd1724ef4cae2fa486ca9dd5051746b1e21b45f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749438846","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera C